# Deep Learning

- FEATURE_DIM **34**; lookback/granularity do checkpoint devem bater com settings
- Label `spot_forward` padrao; mudar label exige retreino + hipotese
- `train.py` vs `run.py`; meta offline em `scripts/operations/train_meta_*`
- Triton/meta opcionais; nao assumir fail-closed sem settings
- ACC / val_accuracy gate importa; nao ignorar deploy_gate
- Sample weighting SSOT: `deep_learning.sample_weighting` — class balance + recency (`recency_half_life_n` default **2000**); `compose_train_weights` no walkforward
- Majority-collapse no deploy: `reject_majority_collapse`, `max_label_call_frac_bias` (0.20), `min_minority_recall` (0.25); telemetria `label_call_frac` / `pred_call_frac` / `minority_recall`
- Calibracao: modo `raw_extreme` substituiu `tcn_macro_override` — raw extremo **nao** substitui Cal; Kelly usa Cal; chaves `tcn_macro_*_override` so limiam raw (nao sao TF MACRO OHLC)
- Vies de classe corrige-se no treino/deploy, nao com veto de sinal live
- Doc: `docs/engineering-deep-learning.md`; skill: `aether-dl-train`
